<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets Novartis warrants.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets Novartis warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued a total of 1.5 million European-style call warrants, on Novartis, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1500.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	17.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9.80 SFR		  GEARING	7.3 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   01.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	11.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1440.00 SFR</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
